<title>UK: JP Morgan sets 1.5 bln French franc 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan sets 1.5 bln French franc 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J.P. MORGAN &amp; CO</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    26.SEP.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.034    PAY DATE    26.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    99.034    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 10,100,1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
